## Option 1: Enhanced VS Code Workspace
json
{
	"folders": [
		{
			"path": ".",
			"name": "Current Project",
			"settings": {
				"files.watcherExclude": {
					"**/node_modules": true,
					"**/dist": true
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"path": "../Mwarokin Estates",
			"name": "Mwarokin Estates",
			"settings": {
				"python.defaultInterpreterPath": "./venv/bin/python"
			}
		}
	],
	"settings": {
		"editor.formatOnSave": true,
		"editor.codeActionsOnSave": {
			"source.fixAll": true
		}
	},
	"tasks": {
		"version": "2.0.0",
		"tasks": [
			{
				"label": "Build All Projects",
				"dependsOrder": "sequence",
				"dependsOn": ["Build Main", "Build Mwarokin"]
			}
		]
	}
}

## Option 2: AI Agent Integration
If you're looking to add AI/automation capabilities:

json
{
	"folders": [
		{
			"path": ".",
			"name": "AI Agent Core"
		},
		{
			"path": "../Mwarokin Estates", 
			"name": "Client Project"
		}
	],
	"extensions": {
		"recommendations": [
			"GitHub.copilot",
			"ms-vscode.vscode-ai",
			"tabnine.tabnine-vscode"
		]
	}
}


## Option 3: Automated Development Workflow
For a more comprehensive agentic system:

json
{
	"folders": [
		{
			"path": ".",
			"name": "Automation Controller"
		},
		{
			"path": "../Mwarokin Estates",
			"name": "Target Application"
		}
	],
	"launch": {
		"configurations": [
			{
				"name": "Run AI Agent",
				"type": "node",
				"request": "launch",
				"program": "${workspaceFolder}/agents/main.js",
				"args": ["--project", "../Mwarokin Estates"]
			}
		]
	}
}


